Checklist text under src/stig_automator/modules/stigs/ is imported from
official Defense Information Systems Agency (DISA) Security Technical
Implementation Guides so generated checklists can show official titles,
discussions, check text, and fix text. Source archive names, download URLs,
and SHA256 checksums for the imported database STIGs are recorded in the
manifest JSON files in that directory.

Imported publications include:

- DISA Kubernetes STIG, Version 2 Release 4 (AKS and EKS modules)
- Microsoft Azure SQL Database STIG
- Microsoft Azure SQL Managed Instance STIG
- Oracle MySQL 8.0 STIG
- Crunchy Data Postgres 16 STIG

That checklist text remains the publication of its original authors, including
DISA and, where applicable, the vendor that produced the STIG. The MIT License
applies to the STIG Automator software and local mapping files.
